        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://roadsidethoughts.com/oh/dunbridge-xx-wood-profile.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Dunbridge sits 660 feet above sea level, giving it a modest elevation typical of Wood County’s rolling hills.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
