        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://roadsidethoughts.com/oh/dunbridge-xx-wood-profile.htm"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The community lies within eastern Middleton Township in Wood County, Ohio, anchoring it in the county’s rural heart.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
